### Manual auth smoke test (VS Code REST Client). Start the web app first: pnpm --filter web dev
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = you@your-domain.com
@password = change-me-to-a-long-password

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/ok

### 1. Sign up. Use an address you can read: Resend's test addresses (e.g. delivered@resend.dev) never show the link.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Manual Test",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Open the verification email link before signing in.
### Without RESEND_API_KEY the link is printed in the dev server log instead.
### Signing in before verifying returns 403.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Session for the cookie set by step 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/get-session

### 4. Protected page: redirects to /sign-in without a session cookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/account
